  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261029-a01",
      "title": "The Missing Cat",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "On Sunday morning, Putri could not find her cat, Momo. She looked under the bed, behind the sofa, and inside every cupboard, but Momo was not there.",
        "Putri made a poster with Momo's photo and put it on the tree in front of her house. Then she asked her neighbors. Mrs. Sari said she saw an orange cat near the park.",
        "Putri ran to the park and called, \"Momo! Momo!\" After five minutes, Momo jumped down from a tall tree. Putri was so happy. That night, Momo slept in Putri's arms."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "missing": "hilang",
        "looked": "mencari",
        "cupboard": "lemari",
        "poster": "poster",
        "neighbors": "tetangga",
        "park": "taman",
        "arms": "pelukan"
      },
